  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A new round of the programme &quot;Master of Science in Land Management&quot; will start in the autumn of 2006. The support will allow 20 students in three turns succesively to study the handling of real estate in market economies. Participants will be students from Western Balkan. The Royal Institute of Technology (KTH)will implement the project.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En ny omg&#xe5;ng av &quot;Master of Science in Land Management&quot; startar h&#xf6;sten 2006. St&#xf6;det medf&#xf6;r att 20 elever att studera fastighetsbildning i marknadsekonomier. Deltagarna &#xe4;r studenter fr&#xe5;n V&#xe4;stra balkan. Kth genomf&#xf6;r projektet.</narrative>
